        "agm_place": "Catur Dharma Hall, Menara Astra Lt.5, JL. Jenderal Sudirman KAV 5-6 Dki. Jakarta / Kota Adm. Jakarta Pusat (Registrasi Ditutup 09.30 WIB Atau Lebih Cepat Jika Jumlah Pemegang Sahamfisik Telah Mencapai 450 Orang)",
        "agm_result": "Agenda #1: Shareholders approved the 2025 Annual Report, the Board of Commissioners' Oversight Report, and the audited Consolidated Financial Statements, granting full discharge to the Board and Directors. The financial statements received a \"fairly stated\" opinion in the report dated February 26, 2026.\nAgenda #2: The meeting approved a total cash dividend of Rp 390 per share and allocated a minimum of Rp 17.10 trillion of the Rp 32.77 trillion net profit to retained earnings. A final dividend of Rp 292 per share is scheduled for payment on May 25, 2026.\nAgenda #3: Prijono Sugiarto was appointed President Commissioner and Rudy as President Director, with most board members' terms set to run until the 2029 Annual General Meeting. The meeting established the full board composition, including specific directors and commissioners and their respective independence and term periods.\nAgenda #4: Shareholders approved a maximum monthly honorarium of Rp 2.16 billion gross for the Board of Commissioners and authorized the Board to determine salaries and benefits for Directors. This mandate is effective from April 23, 2026, until the 2027 Annual General Meeting.\nAgenda #5: KAP Rintis, Jumadi, Rianto & Rekan (PwC) and Buntoro Rianto were appointed to audit the company's 2026 financial statements. The Board of Directors was authorized to determine the honorarium and terms of the appointment."
      },
