        "agm_time": "09:00:00",
        "agm_place": "Catur Dharma Hall, Menara Astra, Lt. 5, Jl. Jenderal Sudirman Kav. 5-6, Jakarta 10220",
        "agm_result": "Agenda #1: Approval of transfer of up to 100,000,000 shares from the third buyback period (16 March 2026 to 15 June 2026) for the management share ownership program (MSOP), with authority delegated to the Nomination and Remuneration Committee and the Board of Directors. The Nomination and Remuneration Committee is authorized to set the exercise price and payment obligation, and the Board of Directors is authorized to take necessary actions for MSOP implementation. Voting results: 26,391,450,625 agreed, 6,250,753,164 disagreed, 188,912,237 abstained.\nAgenda #2: Approval of a share buyback of up to Rp8,000,000,000,000 under POJK No. 29/2023, with authority given to the Board of Directors to execute the buyback, including determining the buyback price and taking necessary actions. Voting results: 32,641,350,427 agreed, 1,441,900 disagreed, 188,323,699 abstained."
